2 CONT Ole Johannes Halvorson, son åt Halvor Ivarson, ø. Bore nr. 38, f. 19/6 1833, d. 24/3 1916,
2 CONT G. 4/6 1857 m. Berta Serina Torkelsd., Pollestad 28f, f. 30/10 1830, d. 13/10 1924.
2 CONT Born:
2 CONT * a. Helmik, f. 5/9 1857, ug., d. 10/2 1940.
2 CONT * b. Johanna, f. 18/3 1859, g. m. Gabriel Gabrielson Høyland, Time.
2 CONT * c. Tønnes, f. 24/12 1860, USA.
2 CONT * d. Tolleiv Emanuel, f. 8/5 1863, USA.
2 CONT * e. Bergitte Olava, f. 22/1 1865, USA, g. m. Adolf Johanesson, Tananger.
2 CONT * f. Olaus, f. 31/12 1866, USA, g. m. Ingeborg Josefsd., Kvål, Høyland.
2 CONT * g. Karl, f. 15/12 1870, bonde på ein part av farsgarden.
2 CONT * h. Justine, f. 18/4 1872, g. m. Daniel Danielson Bore, Friestad, nr. 75.
2 CONT * i. Johan, f. 13/6 1876, bonde på farsgarden.
2 CONT Ole Johannes fekk skøyte på 1 1/2 sp. skyld 1,22, og etter fråsal av br. nr. 10, 1,12. Førd 1863, til 1906. Skøyte 24/4 1869.
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT Reiste til Amerika.
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT (
2 CONT Tonnes Olsen change both first, and last name after he came to the USA. He change first from Tonnes to Thomas, and last name from Engelsvol to Olsen. What the reason for it is not known?
2 CONT Thomas "Tonnes" Olsen arrived in the US, by using the name Tonnes Olsen, and when his daughter, "(Larense Agnete, or Florence Anida)" during the birth of daughter using the same name, on 27 Apr 1889, on her Baptist Certificate, at
2 CONC  the Bethel Swedish Lutheran Church, in Houtzdale, Pa. He arrived in New York City on 14 Apr 1884.
2 CONT He was the son of Ole Johanes Halvorsen/Englesvoll, and Berthe Serina Toelsdatter.Pollestad, of Norway.
2 CONT His children as follows; 1. Oley Burt b. 27 May 1887, and m. Agnes (Andrew), 2. Florence Anida b. 27 Apr 1889, and m. George David West, 3. Olga Magreta (Olsen) Bergan b. 1892-1896, she died somewhere in Austin, Texas?? ***Please 
2 CONC let me know if anyone finds anything on her?? 4. Bessie D. b. 1889, m. Joseph C. Barger, 5. Oscar Arthur b. 6 Aug 1891, m. Leola Virgina (Custer) 6. Bertha b. 21 Feb 1894, m. Walter James McGill, 7. Tacla b. 1901, m. Frank Hamm, a
2 CONC nd Lloyd Wright 8. Anna D. b. 1903, m. John Evans. All in born in Houtzdale, Clearfield Co., Pa.
2 CONT )
