2 CONT
2 CONT Synnøve Macody Lund (born 24 May 1976) is a Norwegian journalist, film critic, model, and actress. She has been working as an actor since 2011, appearing first as the character Diana Brown in Morten Tyldum's BAFTA Award film Headh
2 CONC unters (Norwegian, Hodejegerne), an action thriller based on the 2008 Jo Nesbø novel of the same name. As of 2020, she appears in the 2020 Netflix series Ragnarok and the 2020 Sky TV series Riviera. 
